arge but slim body enormous wings and a  large jagged head  this rodan's face was different from any  of the later suits as it had a menacing  angry expression on its face also its  beak was broader  more jagged and actually bare teeth  inside its mouth  on top of its head the suit had jagged  horns this rodent was 164 feet tall  and had a 394 feet wingspan  number three rodan from 1964 to 65.  this form of rodan made its first debut  appearance in godzilla's movies  in 1964 in the film ghidorah the  three-headed master  the sun dai kaiju raido form looks very  similar to his predecessor shoulda rado  but with significant differences  alterations from rhodan's previous  traits include more rounded wings with  show claws  a longer neck a smaller and thinner beak  and large expressive eyes in contrast to  the pitch-black eyes of should i rado  this form is of the same size and also  called as dyson sorredo  in an invasion of astral monster it was  the rodan form  used in two movies which are 1964 and  1965  and also in both of these movies it  appeared both as a rival and an ally of  godzilla  rodan 1968 the source shingeki rado is  the rodan design used in 1968  in the movie destroy all monsters the  social gekkiredo's name comes from the  film's japanese title  specifically so shingeki meaning attack  of the marching monsters  and naredo which is rodin's japanese  name a radon though similar in  appearance to its predecessors  should i radio and sunday kaiju rado  but this design the social geeky raider  form  has slightly longer horns the wings  appear to be longer and more  tyrannodont-like  and the beak is longer and pointed  downwards the size of this form is also  the same as the others  and in this one the face of this  particular rodan also appears to have a  droopy like  look into it which makes it look less  menacing and more goofy  rodan 1993 appearing in the 1993 movie  godzilla versus maker godzilla  in this form like the show of rodan it  resembles a gigantic pterosaur that  stands upright on two legs  however while technically 20 meters  taller than the shower incarnations  the heisei rhoda is considerably smaller  than the godzilla  he appeared alongside with rodin's wings  also appear somewhat larger in  proportion to the rest of his body  his swings have visible blood vessels  running through them  rodan possesses three spikes on the back  of his head instead of two  and to date it is the only incarnation  of the character  with this straight in addition he also  has a row of pointed spikes running down  the length of its back  as well as a pointed tail and rodan's  skin here  is initially brown in color fire rodan  seen in the same movie only in the later  scenes this  fire rodan was the main inspiration for  monster vs titanos rodan  the fire demon it was a more powerful  form of the same  normal roland and godzilla versus  mechagodzilla 1993  it came to be after godzilla sent the  normal rodent down to the dumbs  with two point blank atomic breath  attacks which so happens to be absorbed  by rodan's cells  and therefore transforming him into a  fire form which is stronger and develops  the ability to emit a purple colored  radioactive heat beam  from its mouth called the uranium heat  beam this rodin  as well as this normal form is 230 feet  tall  with a 394 feet wingspan and it is in  this form that it sacrifices itself to  save godzilla from death  number seven final wars rodan also known  as millennium rodan it is seen as a  giant tyrannodont kaiju who  appeared in the 2004 godzilla film  godzilla final walls  as a mind control pawn of the zillion  aliens and the millennium rodent is made  to closely resemble the 1956 original  design  with large wings spiky armored plates on  its chest  a long neck two horns on the back of its  head  unique aspects of this rodance design  include its orange colored skin  and especially long neck and legs upward  slanted horns and green eyes this  rhodan's body is considerably slimmer  and his armored chest plating is  yellow in color and extends down to his  legs rodan has pronounced fingers on  these wings in this design  and this design is extremely tall at 328  feet with a wingspan of 656 feet  across number eight singular point rodan  this form of roland will appear in the  upcoming movie godzilla's singular point  this incarnation of rodan retains the  character's co-design traits as being a  giant pterosaur with two  crests on its head and spikes on its  chest however  this rodan much more closely resembles a  real pteranodon in terms of his bodily  proportions  although seen in only the official  trailer this rodan is shaking it up with  controversies ahead firstly for his red  trail gas that appears behind it when it  flew past the city  secondly when it is seen in a big flock  which means it might actually be a  species  a whole species that still and lastly  when it appears  in a wholly different form with some  reddit users terming it as  the fire rodan form however this rodent  size is unknown  but it's hardly to be more than the size  of a house  and with this we come to the end of this  list of the nine forms and designs of  rodan  we hope you liked it and we will be  doing more videos like these for the  other kaiju like mothra and all  so do hit that like and subscribe button  to support us  and also do share it with your kaiju  friends but most of all do not forget to  smash that notification bell for regular  updates  on new and upcoming videos  you
 

